              "node": {
                "text": "111K likes, 924 comments - cakeontherun on July 16, 2026: \"Feta and tomato cottage cheese bread!\nRecipe serves 1:\n💚 3 heaped tbsp (60g) self raising flour (or plain/all purpose + 1/2 tsp baking powder)\n💚 2 tbsp (50g) cottage cheese \n💚 1 tbsp chopped feta, 1 tbsp tomato, 1 tsp basil\n1️⃣ Mix everything in a bowl so it clumps together.\n2️⃣ Use your hands to squeeze the dough into a boule shape. It should not be soft NOT sticky. Add more flour if it is. Score on top with a sharp knife.\n3️⃣ Air fry on 180C for 20 minutes (air fry mode) or oven bake on 180C for 35 mins. If it’s not cooked in the middle, turn it over and cook for a further 3-5 mins without baking paper underneath.\n\n#cottagecheese #airfryerrecipes #yoghurtbread #sourdough #highprotein \n\n© CakeOnTheRun\". "
